From: immich-windows <local@immich-windows.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] poppler: include vector for FontInfoScanner

FontInfo.h declares std::vector but does not include its standard header. Add
the direct include required by the Windows Clang build.
---
 poppler/FontInfo.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/poppler/FontInfo.h b/poppler/FontInfo.h
--- a/poppler/FontInfo.h
+++ b/poppler/FontInfo.h
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@
 #include <optional>
 #include <string>
 #include <unordered_set>
+#include <vector>
 
 class Dict;
 class GfxFont;
